<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1395944390"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1492888305"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="悠遠抄"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="鈴湯 / Active Planets &amp; AUGUST"/><amll:meta key="album" value="桃幻浪漫 ～千の刃濤、桃花染の皇姫 花あかり～"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:22.705"><div begin="00:13.357" end="04:22.705"><p begin="00:13.357" end="00:21.262" itunes:key="L1">ひらりひらり 薄紅の欠片載せた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一片 一片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ra ri hi ra ri</span></p><p begin="00:21.263" end="00:25.484" itunes:key="L2">指が紬ぐひととせ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no se ta yu bi ga tsu mu gi gu hi to to se</span></p><p begin="00:25.485" end="00:31.100" itunes:key="L3">ゆうら揺れて雪化粧の季節<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">悠悠摇晃 银装素裹的季节</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u ra yu re te yu ki ge sho u no ki se tsu</span></p><p begin="00:31.101" end="00:37.069" itunes:key="L4">踏みしめる姿馳せた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放任踩踏的姿态</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu mi shi me ru su ga ta ha se ta</span></p><p begin="00:37.070" end="00:42.801" itunes:key="L5">過ぎた道よ輝けと願って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿走过的路能闪耀光辉</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gi ta mi chi yo ka ga ya ke to ne ga 't te</span></p><p begin="00:42.802" end="00:53.021" itunes:key="L6">貴方を連れてゆこう 光の源へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带领你去往光的源头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta wo tsu re te yu ko u hi ka ri no mi na mo to he</span></p><p begin="00:53.022" end="00:59.999" itunes:key="L7">綾模様織り成して 夢のよう流る時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">织成斜行的花纹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ya mo yo u o ri na shi te</span></p><p begin="01:00.000" end="01:05.192" itunes:key="L8">千年の歓び巡り逢えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">邂逅了千年的欲望</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n ne n no yo ro ko bi me gu ri a e ta</span></p><p begin="01:05.193" end="01:08.082" itunes:key="L9">生まれ変われずとも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使不能重生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ka wa re zu to mo</span></p><p begin="01:08.083" end="01:11.415" itunes:key="L10">生まれく愛続く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生而不息的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ku a i tsu du ku</span></p><p begin="01:11.416" end="01:31.419" itunes:key="L11">悠遠の始まり今貴方と歩みましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在与你一同踏上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u e n no ha ji ma ri i ma</span></p><p begin="01:31.420" end="01:37.034" itunes:key="L12">しゃなりしゃなり薄紅の頬が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装模作样地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha na ri sha na ri</span></p><p begin="01:37.035" end="01:42.153" itunes:key="L13">いつも笑みを忘れぬように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿永远不要忘记微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo e mi wo wa su re nu yo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:42.154" end="01:48.250" itunes:key="L14">ほうら哀しみなど玉響と<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讲述短暂的哀伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho u ra ka na shi mi na do ta ma yu ra to</span></p><p begin="01:48.251" end="01:54.327" itunes:key="L15">悠遠の軌跡語ろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与悠远的轨迹吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u e n no ki se ki ka ta ro u</span></p><p begin="01:54.328" end="01:59.939" itunes:key="L16">過ぎた人よ幸あれと願って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">逝去的人啊 祝你幸福</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gi ta hi to yo sa chi a re to ne ga 't te</span></p><p begin="01:59.940" end="02:10.952" itunes:key="L17">貴方と求めてゆく代え難きしあわせ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我和你一起追求</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to mo to me te yu ku</span></p><p begin="02:10.953" end="02:17.071" itunes:key="L18">色模様染め成して 花のよう開く時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">染成了颜色和图案</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro mo yo u so me na shi te</span></p><p begin="02:17.072" end="02:22.142" itunes:key="L19">千年の移ろいの中褪せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">千年变迁中不褪色</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n ne n no u tsu ro i no na ka a se na i</span></p><p begin="02:22.143" end="02:25.353" itunes:key="L20">生まれた意味を知る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">知晓了诞生的意义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ta i mi wo shi ru</span></p><p begin="02:25.354" end="02:28.459" itunes:key="L21">生まれく物のため<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了诞生之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma re ku mo no no ta me</span></p><p begin="02:28.460" end="02:37.488" itunes:key="L22">悠遠の物語を綴りましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谱写一个悠远的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u e n no mo no ga ta ri wo tsu du ri ma sho u</span></p><p begin="02:37.489" end="03:00.341" itunes:key="L23">歴史とは諸人が重ねた愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">历史是诸人交叠的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">re ki shi to ha mo ro bi to ga ka sa ne ta a i</span></p><p begin="03:00.342" end="03:06.064" itunes:key="L24">宴にも似た同じ時代に在りて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同宴会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta ge ni mo ni ta</span></p><p begin="03:06.065" end="03:14.365" itunes:key="L25">貴方と紬ぎ出したは常しえ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我与你编织出的便是永恒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na ta to tsu mu gi da shi ta ha do ko shi e</span></p><p begin="03:14.366" end="03:19.867" itunes:key="L26">綾模様織り成して 夢のよう流る時<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">织成斜行的花纹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ya mo yo u o ri na shi te</span></p><p begin="03:19.868" end="03:25.083" itunes:key="L27">千年の温もりに抱(いだ)かれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀抱于千年的温暖中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se n ne n no nu ku mo ri ni da ka re ta</span></p><p begin="03:25.084" end="03:28.208" itunes:key="L28">とめどない冷たい夜も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无尽冰冷的夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to me do na i tsu me ta i yo ru mo</span></p><p begin="03:28.209" end="03:31.386" itunes:key="L29">止まらず歩みましょう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也不要停下脚步</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ma ra zu a yu mi ma sho u</span></p><p begin="03:31.387" end="03:43.266" itunes:key="L30">悠遠の始まりだと今なら分かるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为现在应当明白</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu u e n no ha ji ma ri da to</span></p><p begin="03:43.267" end="03:54.891" itunes:key="L31">綾のように交わりながら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像斜纹一样交错着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ya no yo u ni ma ji wa ri na ga ra</span></p><p begin="03:54.892" end="04:22.705" itunes:key="L32">花のように美しく生く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像花一样美丽地生长</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na no yo u ni u tsu ku shi ku yu ku</span></p></div></body></tt>